@* Exercise 058 - Bind Directive Modifiers (intermediate).
   Goal:   Change when a binding writes, how it renders, and what runs right after it.
   Drills: @bind:event (a custom update trigger), @bind:format (display and parse
           format), @bind:after (post-update hook).
   Passes: dotnet test --filter FullyQualifiedName~Ex058_ *@
<span id="echo">@_note</span>
<span id="edits">@Edits</span>
<span id="due-echo">@_due.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd")</span>

